  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Processing of Requests for Country Specific Information for the Austrian Ministry of the Interior</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the Country of Origin Information Unit of the Federal Office for Immigration and Asylum (BFA) within the Austrian Ministry of the Interior to make well-informed assessments regarding the individual reintegration perspectives of migrants in their country of return. Together with IOM missions in countries of return, IOM Austria will compile neutral, objective, relevant and up-to-date return related country of origin information.</narrative>
  </description>
